    "paragraph": "A literature review categorizes research on digital twins for smart intersections across five core themes, including structural architectures, data processing, and traffic control AI. Circular statistics were used to analyze spatial directionality and temporal patterns in new restaurant openings across Madrid between 2018 and 2024. Another study evaluated urban public space performance in Luxor, Egypt, by combining observational fieldwork with a questionnaire survey of 339 participants across Railway Station Square and the Luxor Temple area.",
